            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Que montre ce code dans la console ?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Polly wants a cracker!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Polly wants a cracker!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Polly wants a cracker!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Polly wants a cracker!\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Polly wants a cracker!</code> trois fois</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Les nombres <code>1</code> à <code>3</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Les nombres <code>0</code> à <code>3</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Polly wants a cracker!</code> trois fois.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La boucle ci-dessous se répète trois fois. Quelle valeur contient <code>i</code> lors de la troisième et dernière répétition ?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Polly wants a cracker!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Polly wants a cracker!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Polly wants a cracker!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Polly wants a cracker!\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Rien, car le corps de la boucle n'utilise jamais <code>i</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assurez-vous de choisir <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>",
